# DUSKLING M21, THE WHITE NEST (room 21): the white nest: walking up to the egg.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 21
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 1
hold LEFT 25
wait 2
expect state == 4
expect egg_got == 0
